WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:04.160
The Parts Portal brings machine parts, product information

00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:06.243
and ordering into one place.

00:00:06.618 --> 00:00:09.085
Find what you need, check the details, and

00:00:09.105 --> 00:00:10.852
order directly through Noordveld.

00:00:12.904 --> 00:00:15.866
Choose the manufacturer and machine model, or search

00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:18.428
by part number, name or description.

00:00:18.738 --> 00:00:21.231
See the parts with recorded compatibility for that

00:00:21.251 --> 00:00:21.761
machine.

00:00:23.792 --> 00:00:28.538
Browse categories such as attachments, brakes, electrical, filtration

00:00:28.558 --> 00:00:29.576
and hydraulics.

00:00:29.886 --> 00:00:32.522
Category and machine filters help you narrow the

00:00:32.542 --> 00:00:34.550
catalogue to the component you need.

00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:39.022
Open the part to see its number, description,

00:00:39.162 --> 00:00:41.001
category and machine fitment.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.605
Check recorded price and availability.

00:00:43.915 --> 00:00:47.957
Supply and source information provide context; missing information

00:00:47.977 --> 00:00:49.399
stays clearly marked.

00:00:51.446 --> 00:00:53.493
Add the required quantity to your cart.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:56.829
Enter the customer and delivery details, select the

00:00:56.849 --> 00:01:01.231
dealer or receiver, then review availability, fulfilment, part

00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:04.912
prices, delivery charges and the complete order total.

00:01:06.946 --> 00:01:09.738
Compare the recorded transport options for the delivery

00:01:09.758 --> 00:01:10.503
location.

00:01:10.813 --> 00:01:14.244
Check dispatch details, distance and travel time after

00:01:14.264 --> 00:01:15.035
dispatch.

00:01:15.357 --> 00:01:17.824
The portal shows the recorded options before you

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:18.863
confirm the order.

00:01:20.904 --> 00:01:23.840
After placing the order, follow its recorded status

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:24.865
in My Orders.

00:01:25.201 --> 00:01:27.860
From choosing the machine to ordering its parts,

00:01:28.014 --> 00:01:30.295
the Parts Portal keeps the journey together.

00:01:30.605 --> 00:01:34.175
Demonstration prices, stock and supply data are labelled.
